    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendHTML": true,
        "subject": "Your cleanup could not start: Gmail access was not given",
        "htmlContent": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c130d;max-width:520px\"><p>Hi {{ $json.body.client.first_name || \"there\" }},</p><p>Your cleanup could not start, because the box that gives me access to your Gmail was not ticked when you signed in with Google.</p><p><b>Your payment is safe and still counts.</b> Watch this short video to see exactly where to tick it, then try again:</p><p><a href=\"{{ $json.body.video_url }}\" style=\"color:#b8642a;font-weight:bold\">Watch the video</a></p><p style=\"margin:24px 0\"><a href=\"{{ $json.body.connect_url }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#e6935a;color:#1c130d;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none\">Try again</a></p><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b5a4a\">If a button does not open, press and hold it to copy the link, then paste it into your browser.</p><p>Thanks,<br>Juliet, SmartInboxCleanup<br><a href=\"https://smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com\" style=\"color:#b8642a\">smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com</a></p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\"><a href=\"https://smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com\"><img src=\"https://hq.buildwithjuliet.com/logo.png\" alt=\"buildwithjuliet\" height=\"48\" style=\"height:48px;width:auto;border:0;display:block\"></a></p></div>",
        "sender": "kosy@buildwithjuliet.com",
