        "htmlContent": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c130d;max-width:520px\"><p>Hi {{ $json.body.client.first_name || \"there\" }},</p><p>Your cleanup stopped, because the access to your Gmail was closed.</p><p><b>Your payment still counts.</b> Connect again and I carry on from where it stopped.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0\"><a href=\"{{ $json.body.connect_url }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#e6935a;color:#1c130d;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none\">Connect my Gmail again</a></p><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b5a4a\">If a button does not open, press and hold it to copy the link, then paste it into your browser.</p><p>Thanks,<br>Juliet, SmartInboxCleanup<br><a href=\"https://smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com\" style=\"color:#b8642a\">smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com</a></p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\"><a href=\"https://smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com\"><img src=\"https://hq.buildwithjuliet.com/logo.png\" alt=\"buildwithjuliet\" height=\"48\" style=\"height:48px;width:auto;border:0;display:block\"></a></p></div>",
